LAMMPS (29 Sep 2021)
# Molecular dynamics simulation

units           metal
boundary        p p p
atom_style      atomic

neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 10 delay 0 check no

read_data       /work/wangs/Django-deepmd/mysite_deepmd/demo001/lammps/md_sys/LiCl.lmp
